{"seq":1,"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology/genetics","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"遗传学\">遗传学</h1><p>遗传学研究基因的传递规律和变异机制——为什么子女像父母但又不完全一样，为什么某些疾病在家族中反复出现，为什么进化能产生如此多样的生命形式。从 Mendel 的豌豆实验到现代基因组学，遗传学经历了从表型观察到分子解析的深刻变革。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p><strong>Mendel 定律</strong>：孟德尔通过豌豆杂交实验发现了两条基本遗传规律。分离定律：一对等位基因在形成配子时彼此分离，每个配子只获得一个等位基因。自由组合定律：不同对的等位基因在形成配子时独立分配（前提是基因位于不同染色体上）。</p>\n<p>对于单基因遗传，杂合子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 自交后代的基因型比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA : Aa : aa = 1 : 2 : 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，表型比（完全显性时）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 : 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>连锁与互换</strong>：位于同一条染色体上的基因倾向于一起遗传（连锁）。Morgan 用果蝇实验证明了连锁现象，并发现减数分裂时同源染色体间的交叉互换可以打破连锁。重组频率用于估算基因间的遗传距离（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span> 重组频率 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> cM，centiMorgan）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遗传模式</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常染色体显性</td>\n<td>每代出现，男女等概率</td>\n<td>亨廷顿舞蹈病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常染色体隐性</td>\n<td>可隔代出现，近亲婚配风险增加</td>\n<td>囊性纤维化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X 连锁隐性</td>\n<td>男性多见，母亲为携带者</td>\n<td>血友病、色盲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X 连锁显性</td>\n<td>女性发病率高于男性</td>\n<td>Rett 综合征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体遗传</td>\n<td>母系遗传</td>\n<td>Leber 遗传性视神经病变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"突变与-dna-修复\">突变与 DNA 修复</h3><p>突变是 DNA 序列的永久性改变。按规模分为点突变（单碱基替换、插入或缺失）和大规模突变（缺失、重复、倒位、易位）。点突变按效应分为：同义突变（不改变氨基酸）、错义突变（改变一个氨基酸）和无义突变（产生终止密码子）。移码突变（插入或缺失非 3 的倍数个碱基）通常是最严重的，因为它改变了下游所有密码子的读框。</p>\n<p>细胞有多种 DNA 修复机制来纠正突变：碱基切除修复（BER）、核苷酸切除修复（NER）、错配修复（MMR）和双链断裂修复（同源重组 HR、非同源末端连接 NHEJ）。修复基因的缺陷与癌症易感性密切相关——如 BRCA1/2 突变增加乳腺癌风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"群体遗传学\">群体遗传学</h3><p>群体遗传学研究等位基因频率在群体中的变化。Hardy-Weinberg 平衡是基准状态：在理想条件下（大群体、随机交配、无突变、无选择、无迁移），等位基因频率和基因型频率保持不变。对于二等位基因系统（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p + q = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^2 + 2pq + q^2 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">pq</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>偏离 Hardy-Weinberg 平衡的五大进化力量：自然选择、遗传漂变、突变、基因流和非随机交配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表观遗传与非经典遗传\">表观遗传与非经典遗传</h3><p>表观遗传修饰（DNA 甲基化、组蛋白修饰）可以在不改变 DNA 序列的情况下影响基因表达，且某些表观遗传标记可以跨代传递。基因组印记是一个典型例子——某些基因只有来自父方或母方的拷贝表达（如 IGF2 只表达父本等位基因）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[遗传学] --&gt; B[经典遗传]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分子遗传]&#10;    A --&gt; D[群体遗传]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Mendel 定律]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[连锁与互换]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[遗传图谱]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[突变类型]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[DNA 修复]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[表观遗传]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Hardy-Weinberg]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[自然选择]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[遗传漂变]\">graph TD\n    A[遗传学] --&gt; B[经典遗传]\n    A --&gt; C[分子遗传]\n    A --&gt; D[群体遗传]\n    B --&gt; B1[Mendel 定律]\n    B --&gt; B2[连锁与互换]\n    B --&gt; B3[遗传图谱]\n    C --&gt; C1[突变类型]\n    C --&gt; C2[DNA 修复]\n    C --&gt; C3[表观遗传]\n    D --&gt; D1[Hardy-Weinberg]\n    D --&gt; D2[自然选择]\n    D --&gt; D3[遗传漂变]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在一个群体中，隐性纯合基因型（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span></span>）的频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/2500</span></span></span></span></span>。假设 Hardy-Weinberg 平衡，计算等位基因频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，以及携带者（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>）的频率。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>果蝇中，基因 A 和 B 的重组频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>，B 和 C 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>，A 和 C 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。画出这三个基因的遗传图谱。如果 A 和 C 的重组频率实际为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18%</span></span></span></span></span>，说明什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么 X 连锁隐性遗传病男性发病率远高于女性？用概率计算说明。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>CRISPR-Cas9 的基因编辑依赖于细胞的哪种 DNA 修复机制？为什么非同源末端连接（NHEJ）常导致基因敲除？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>基因组印记如何解释 Prader-Willi 综合征和 Angelman 综合征的区别（两者都涉及 15q11-q13 区域的缺失，但临床表现完全不同）？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Griffiths 等《Introduction to Genetic Analysis》——遗传学的经典入门教材。</li>\n<li>Hartwell 等《Genetics: From Genes to Genomes》——整合分子与经典遗传学。</li>\n<li>刘祖洞《遗传学》（高等教育出版社）——国内广泛使用的教材。</li>\n<li>Lynch &amp; Walsh《Genetics and Analysis of Quantitative Traits》——数量遗传学的权威参考。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>遗传学从 Mendel 的分离定律出发，经过连锁分析、突变研究和群体遗传理论的发展，构建了理解基因传递和变异的完整框架。现代遗传学融合了分子生物学和基因组学的工具，使我们能够在 DNA 水平上精确解析遗传现象。从个体的遗传病诊断到群体的进化动态，遗传学提供了统一的理论视角。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"遗传学","id":"遗传学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"突变与 DNA 修复","id":"突变与-dna-修复"},{"level":3,"text":"群体遗传学","id":"群体遗传学"},{"level":3,"text":"表观遗传与非经典遗传","id":"表观遗传与非经典遗传"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生物化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/biochemistry"},"next":{"title":"植物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology/plant-biology"}}